<% layout("/layouts/boilerPlate") %>

<div class="container mt-5 mb-5">
    <div class="row justify-content-center">
        <div class="col-md-10 col-lg-8">
            <h1 class="fw-bold mb-4">Privacy & Data Policy</h1>
            <p class="text-muted">Last Updated: July 2026</p>
            
            <hr class="mb-4">

            <section class="mb-5">
                <h4 class="fw-bold">1. Information We Collect</h4>
                <p>When you use AuraStays, we collect information you provide directly (such as your name, email, and profile details) and information we collect automatically (such as IP addresses and device information).</p>
                
                <h5 class="mt-3">Geographic Security Data</h5>
                <p>To protect your account from unauthorized access, our "Impossible Travel" security engine logs your IP address and approximate geographic coordinates during login attempts. This data is strictly used for fraud prevention.</p>
            </section>

            <section class="mb-5">
                <h4 class="fw-bold">2. Third-Party Data Processors</h4>
                <p>AuraStays relies on secure, enterprise-grade third-party services to function. By using our platform, you acknowledge that your data may be processed by:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Mapbox:</strong> For location mapping and geocoding services.</li>
                    <li><strong>Cloudinary:</strong> For secure hosting of your uploaded property and profile images.</li>
                    <li><strong>Brevo SMTP:</strong> For the delivery of essential security alerts and One-Time Passwords (OTPs) to your email inbox.</li>
                </ul>
            </section>

            <section class="mb-5">
                <h4 class="fw-bold">3. Account Deletion & Data Retention</h4>
                <p>You have the right to request the deletion of your account and personal data at any time. Security logs (such as login timestamps and IP addresses) are retained for 90 days for audit purposes before being permanently wiped.</p>
            </section>

        </div>
    </div>
</div>